IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SALDO-BANCARIO.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 SALDO-INICIAL PIC 9(6)V99 VALUE 0.
01 DEPOSITO PIC 9(6)V99 VALUE 0.
01 RETIRO PIC 9(6)V99 VALUE 0.
01 SALDO-FINAL PIC 9(6)V99 VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "INGRESE EL SALDO INICIAL:"
    ACCEPT SALDO-INICIAL
    DISPLAY "INGRESE EL MONTO A DEPOSITAR:"
    ACCEPT DEPOSITO
    DISPLAY "INGRESE EL MONTO A RETIRAR:"
    ACCEPT RETIRO
    COMPUTE SALDO-FINAL = SALDO-INICIAL + DEPOSITO - RETIRO
    DISPLAY "EL SALDO FINAL ES: " SALDO-FINAL
    STOP RUN.
